      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AMENDMENTS TO THE REAL PROPERTY GAINS TAX ACT 1976 Commencement of amendments to the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III__cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paragraph 36(1)(b) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “section 27 or subsection 28(3)” the words “section 27, subsection 28(3), section 28a or 28b”. and Enforcement of Tax New section 43a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III__cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 43 the following section: “Power to issue guidelines 43a. (1) The Director General may issue guidelines as the Director General thinks expedient or necessary to clarify the provisions of this Act or to facilitate the compliance of the law or any other matter relating to this Act. (2) The Director General may revoke, revise or amend the whole or any part of any guidelines issued under this section.”. Amendment of section 51"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III__cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 51 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1a) The Director General may, by notice in writing, withdraw at any time the declaration made under subsection (1).”. Amendment of section 57a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III__cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III__cl_13__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III__cl_13__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 57a of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III__cl_13__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (3), by substituting for the words “in writing” the words “in a prescribed form”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III__cl_13__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsection: “(3a) The authorization referred to in subsection (3) shall be furnished to the Director General on an electronic medium or by way of electronic transmission in accordance with this section.”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III__cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III__cl_6__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III__cl_6__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III__cl_6__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III__cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Sections 7, 8, 9, 10, 11 and 12 come into operation on 1 January 2026."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III__cl_6__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III__cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 13 comes into operation on 1 January 2027. Amendment of section 13"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III__cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Part, is amended in section 13 by inserting after subsection (7) the following subsections: “(8) A person who disposes of a chargeable asset and is required to make a return under this section may notify the acquirer the amount of tax payable on the chargeable gain for the disposal in the return made under subsection (1) for the purposes of section 21b. (9) The notification made under subsection (8) shall be deemed to have been served on the acquirer by the disposer on an electronic medium or by way of electronic transmission on the day which the return made under subsection (1) is furnished to the Director General.”. Amendment of section 13a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III__cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 13a of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1a) The person referred to in subsection (1) shall furnish to the Director General an amended return in the prescribed form on an electronic medium or by way of electronic transmission in accordance with section 57a.”. Amendment of section 19a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III__cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paragraph 19 a(5)(a) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “in writing” the words “in the prescribed form”. Amendment of section 36"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_II__cl_3",
