      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1a) Where a person referred to in paragraphs 86(1)(a) and (b) has furnished to the Director General a return in accordance with section 86, that person shall provide information and furnish documents as may be determined by the Director General for the purpose of ascertaining the divisible income or the divisible loss from the business of a partnership on an electronic medium or by way of electronic transmission within thirty days after the due date for furnishing of the return.”; and"
      }
