      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AMENDMENTS TO THE STAMP ACT 1949 Commencement of amendments to the Stamp Act 1949"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV__cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Part comes into operation on 1 January 2026. Amendment of section 4a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV__cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Stamp Act 1949, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Part, is amended in subsection 4a(3) by substituting for the words “not exceeding two hundred and fifty ringgit” the words “of not less than one thousand ringgit and not exceeding ten thousand ringgit”. Amendment of section 9"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV__cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 9(3) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “two hundred ringgit or ten per centum” the words “five hundred ringgit or twenty per centum”. Amendment of section 12a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV__cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "hasPart": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV__cl_17__para_aa",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 12a of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “Item 32(a) or (aa)” the words “Item 32(a),"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV__cl_17__para_aa",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "aa",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV__cl_17",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "or (ab)”. Amendment of section 17"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV__cl_18",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "18",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 17 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “Item 32(a) or (aa)” wherever appearing the words “Item 32(a), (aa) or (ab)”. Amendment of section 20"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV__cl_19",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "19",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 20(4) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “Item 32(a) or (aa)” the words “Item 32(a), (aa) or (ab)”. and Enforcement of Tax Amendment of section 20b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV__cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 20b(2) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “Item 32(a) or (aa)” the words “Item 32(a), (aa) or (ab)”. Amendment of section 35a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "21",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 35a(2) of the principal Act is amended by deleting the words “for a year of assessment”. Amendment of section 36"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "22",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 36 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection (2) the following subsection: “(2) For the purposes of this Act, where— (a) the return is furnished together with an instrument within the period specified in section 43 or 47, and the Collector is deemed to have made an assessment under paragraph (1)(a)— (i) the return shall be deemed to be an assessment; and (ii) the duty payable on the instrument shall be due and payable and the instrument shall be stamped within thirty days from the date of the assessment by the Collector; or (b) the return is furnished together with an instrument not within the period specified in section 43 or 47, and the Collector is deemed to have made an assessment under paragraph (1)(a)— (i) the return shall be deemed to be an assessment; and (ii) the duty payable on the instrument shall be due and payable and the instrument shall be stamped within thirty days from the date of the assessment by the Collector together with the penalty payable under section 47a.”. Amendment of section 36d"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "23",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 36d(2) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words “section 36b” the words “, 36ca”. Amendment of section 47a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "24",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 47 a(1) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words “in or under” the words “subsection 36(2),”. Amendment of section 61"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "25",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 61 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “not exceeding two thousand five hundred ringgit” the words “of not less than two thousand five hundred ringgit and not exceeding fifty thousand ringgit”. Amendment of section 63"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 63(1) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “not exceeding one thousand five hundred ringgit” the words “of not less than one thousand ringgit and not exceeding ten thousand ringgit”. Amendment of section 64"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV__cl_27",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "27",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 64 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “not exceeding one thousand five hundred ringgit” the words “of not less than one thousand ringgit and not exceeding ten thousand ringgit”. and Enforcement of Tax Amendment of section 72a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV__cl_28",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "28",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 72a of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “not exceeding five thousand ringgit” the words “of not less than two thousand five hundred ringgit and not exceeding fifty thousand ringgit”. New section 76b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV__cl_29",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "29",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 76a the following section: “Power to issue guidelines 76b. (1) The Collector may issue guidelines as the Collector thinks expedient or necessary to clarify the provisions of this Act or to facilitate the compliance of the law or any other matter relating to this Act. (2) The Collector may revoke, revise or amend the whole or any part of any guidelines issued under this section.”. Amendment of section 77a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV__cl_30",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "30",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paragraph 77a(1)(f) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words “39(4)” the words “, 50b(2)”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_I__cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Measures for the Collection, Administration and Enforcement of Tax Act 2025. Amendment of Acts"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_I__cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Income Tax Act 1967 [Act 53], the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976 [Act 169], the Stamp Act 1949 [Act 378], the Labuan Business Activity Tax Act 1990 [Act 445] and the Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967 [Act 543] are amended in the manner specified in Parts II, III, IV, V and VI respectively."
      }
    },
    {
