      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paragraphs 43 (a), (b) and (c) come into operation on 1 January 2027. New section 67a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "42",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Part, is amended by inserting after section 67 the following section: “Power to issue guidelines 67 a. (1) The Director General may issue guidelines as the Director General thinks expedient or necessary to clarify the provisions of this Act or to facilitate the compliance of the law or any other matter relating to this Act. (2) The Director General may revoke, revise or amend the whole or any part of any guidelines issued under this section.”. Amendment of section 82a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "43",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__para_d"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 82a of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (3), by substituting for the words “in writing” the words “in a prescribed form”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (3a), by substituting for the words “in writing” the words “in a prescribed form”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (3a) the following subsection: “(3b) The authorization referred to in subsections (3) and (3a) shall be furnished to the Director General on an electronic medium or by way of electronic transmission in accordance with this section.”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (4) the following subsection: “(4) A prescribed form furnished in accordance with subsection (3) or (3a) on behalf of any chargeable person or person referred to in subsection 27(2) shall be presumed to have been furnished on and Enforcement of Tax the authority of the chargeable person or person referred to in subsection 27(2), until the contrary is proved, and the chargeable person or person referred to in subsection 27(2) shall be deemed to be cognizant of its contents.”."
      }
    },
    {
