      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Sections 32, 33, 34, 35, 36, 37, 38 and 40, paragraphs 39(a), (b), (f), (g) and (h) and subparagraph 39(c)(ii) come into operation on 1 January 2026."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_V__cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subparagraph 39(c)(i) and paragraphs 39(d) and (e) come into operation on 1 January 2027. Amendment of section 3a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_V__cl_32",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "32",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Labuan Business Activity Tax Act 1990, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Part, is amended in section 3a by substituting for the words “in the prescribed form” the words “in the form as determined by the Director General”. Amendment of section 5"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/39/eng@/~part_V__cl_33",
